    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel-type game centered around performing various experiments with the android &quot;Femme&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This completely emotionless android will develop according to the researchers you assign to her. What will her AI learn, and how will it use this knowledge to save humanity?<br><br>All of this depends on you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay &amp; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an important step towards humanity's future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your hypotheses and perform experiments.<br><br>Your allotted training period is 30 days. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, you have 30 tries to develop Femme into the ideal android.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690240/extras/418f7ac51a98c68e5cc6ec2cd987b641.avif?t=1750726838\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name: Femme Fatale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occupation: Android (Prototype)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: Newly built</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characteristics: Emotionless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personality: Under construction</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel-type game centered around performing various experiments with the android &quot;Femme&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This completely emotionless android will develop according to the researchers you assign to her. What will her AI learn, and how will it use this knowledge to save humanity?<br><br>All of this depends on you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay &amp; Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an important step towards humanity's future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your hypotheses and perform experiments.<br><br>Your allotted training period is 30 days. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, you have 30 tries to develop Femme into the ideal android.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690240/extras/418f7ac51a98c68e5cc6ec2cd987b641.avif?t=1750726838\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name: Femme Fatale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occupation: Android (Prototype)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: Newly built</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characteristics: Emotionless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personality: Under construction</p>",
